From 2dc038c6fa74e00ddb265b274103c46894c2541a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Matti=20Lehtim=C3=A4ki?= <matti.lehtimaki@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:30:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: wcn36xx: Add the WCN3660A RF variant
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Classify WCN3660A with WCN3660/WCN3660B, retaining the distinct
compatible required by its power configuration. Do not classify it
as WCN3680, which enables VHT capabilities.

Refresh Matti Lehtimäki's original implementation from 3cc8fd9f5851
on the current wireless integration base. All other resource handling
and current upstream allocation changes remain unchanged.

Refreshed with OpenAI Codex assistance. Human review and DCO
certification remain pending.
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c
index ad8a4bd91..0bbe8cf06 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c
@@ -1538,6 +1538,7 @@ static int wcn36xx_platform_get_resources(struct wcn36xx *wcn,
 		if (of_device_is_compatible(iris_node, "qcom,wcn3620"))
 			wcn->rf_id = RF_IRIS_WCN3620;
 		if (of_device_is_compatible(iris_node, "qcom,wcn3660") ||
+		    of_device_is_compatible(iris_node, "qcom,wcn3660a") ||
 		    of_device_is_compatible(iris_node, "qcom,wcn3660b"))
 			wcn->rf_id = RF_IRIS_WCN3660;
 		if (of_device_is_compatible(iris_node, "qcom,wcn3680"))
